      "default": "<p>Formulas I and II are reproduced from MIL-STD-2073-1E w/CHANGE 4, section 5.2.3.7.b. Bag sizes and the definition of a unit are from MIL-D-3464E. This tool is provided for reference only. The result is the minimum quantity the standard computes from the values you enter; it does not replace the packaging engineer's judgment on enclosure selection, dunnage weight or item characteristics. Always verify against the current revision of the standard at the DLA ASSIST database and against the requirements of your specific contract or drawing.</p>"
    }
